{"id":51657,"date":"2026-06-14T07:08:57","date_gmt":"2026-06-14T06:08:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51657"},"modified":"2026-09-06T18:46:20","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06T17:46:20","slug":"trail-do-sor","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-sor\/","title":{"rendered":"XIII Trail do Sor 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">XIII Trail do Sor 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>XIII Trail do Sor 2026<\/strong> decorre a <strong>6 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> na cidade de <strong>Ponte de Sor<\/strong>, no distrito de Portalegre. Organizada pelo <strong>Clube de Atletismo Trail Runners da Ponte<\/strong> com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio e da Freguesia de Ponte de Sor, a prova leva os participantes a percorrer trilhos sinalizados, estrad\u00f5es florestais e relevos ondulados ao longo das margens panor\u00e2micas do <strong>Rio Sor<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida no <strong>Mercado Municipal de Ponte de Sor<\/strong>, o evento integra o <strong>Circuito Nacional de Trail (s\u00e9rie 100)<\/strong>, o <strong>Circuito Nacional de Trail Sprint (s\u00e9rie 150)<\/strong> e o <strong>Circuito Jovem<\/strong> da ATRP, al\u00e9m dos circuitos distritais da AADP. O programa \u00e9 diversificado e inclui o <strong>Trail Longo (31 km)<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto (17 km)<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini-Trail (10 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong> e provas dedicadas \u00e0s camadas jovens e infantis.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-bo